        <activityName xml:lang="en">Mineral wool insulation 60mm, cladding with reinforced alumium foil</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Mineral wool insulation 60mm, cladding with reinforced alumium foil
Production of a thermal insulation of pipes for heating systems;
UUID: 466e7a7e-4db9-3289-906a-06fc307138db
Materials used for the production. Energy use for the different production steps. Transport of raw materials to the plant.
Location: Data sources mainly from Switzerland. Process applicable in central European conditions.
Technology: Typical technology, materials and components used for pipe insulation of heating systems in appartment and commercial buildings
Time period: Amount of material investigated in 2013.
Production volume: na
Sampling: Manufacturer informations and literature data. Data of typical product used. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_466e7a7e-4db9-3289-906a-06fc307138db.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
